<title>HUNGARY: Riga airport cargo trade falls 7.9 pct in Feb y/y.</title>
<headline>Riga airport cargo trade falls 7.9 pct in Feb y/y.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Riga International Airport (RIX) in Latvia said on Friday its cargo trade fell 7.9 percent in February 1997 from February 1996.</p>
<p> RIGA INTERNATIONAL AIRPORT	 FEB 97    FEB 96   PCT CHANGE</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> CARGO TRADE (in tonnes)	     307.5     333.7	   -7.9</p>
<p> SAS					  92.4     110.9	  -16.7</p>
<p> Lufthansa				  63.6	50.0	  +27.2</p>
<p> Finnair				    35.4	39.7	  -10.8</p>
<p> Air Baltic				 27.3	27.8	   -1.8</p>
<p> Riga Airlines			    23.5	 4.5	 +422.2</p>
<p> Austrian Airlines			11.0	 5.6	  +96.4</p>
<p> Transaero				   9.2	 6.8	  +35.3</p>
<p> CSA					   8.5	 5.4	  +57.4</p>
<p> AP Airlines				 7.1	 0.0		-</p>
<p> LOT					   6.7	 7.0	   -4.3</p>
<p> Russian International Airlines	5.5	 5.7	   -3.5</p>
<p> Others				     17.4	70.3	  -75.2</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> CARGO EXPORTS (in tonnes)	    44.9	38.1	  +17.8</p>
<p> Air Baltic				 10.9	 9.2	  +18.5</p>
<p> Finnair				     7.0	 3.8	  +84.2</p>
<p> SAS					   5.4	 3.9	  +38.5</p>
<p> Lufthansa				   5.3	 7.7	  -31.2</p>
<p> Russian International Airlines	4.8	 3.8	  +26.3</p>
<p> Transaero				   3.2	 3.0	   +6.7</p>
<p> AP Airlines				 1.9	 0.0		-</p>
<p> Riga Airlines			     1.4	 1.0	  +40.0</p>
<p> CSA					   1.4	 0.8	  +75.0</p>
<p> LOT					   0.6	 1.2	  -50.0</p>
<p> Austrian Airlines			 0.0	 0.0		-</p>
<p> Others					3.0	 3.7	  -18.9</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> CARGO IMPORTS (in tonnes)	   262.6     295.6	  -11.2</p>
<p> SAS					  87.0     107.0	  -18.7</p>
<p> Lufthansa				  58.3	42.3	  +37.8</p>
<p> Finnair				    28.4	35.8	  -20.7</p>
<p> Riga Airlines			    22.0	 3.5	 +528.6</p>
<p> Air Baltic				 16.4	18.6	  -11.8</p>
<p> Austrian Airlines			11.0	 5.6	  +96.4</p>
<p> CSA					   7.1	 4.6	  +54.3</p>
<p> LOT					   6.1	 5.8	   +5.2</p>
<p> Transaero				   6.1	 3.8	  +60.5</p>
<p> AP Airlines				 5.2	 0.0		-</p>
<p> Russian International Airlines	0.8	 1.8	  -55.6</p>
<p> Others				     14.2	66.8	  -78.7</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>NOTE - RIX, which operates under jurisdiction of Latvia's Ministry of Transport and Communications, is owned completely by the Latvian state. The sum of exports and imports might not equal the totals for some airlines due to rounding of the data.</p>
<p>-- Ryan Tutak, Budapest newsroom (36 1) 266 2410</p>
